# Sarcophagus, Ship of the Dead {2}{R}: "Station (Tap another creature you control: Put charge counters equal to its power
# on this Spacecraft...) 10+ | Flying". Targ Wrangler is a 5/3 with +1/+0 from the Sarcophagus, so stationing with it twice,
# a turn apart, puts twelve charge counters on: the Spacecraft is then a 4/4 artifact creature with flying, and a creature
# dying afterwards adds no charge counter because the intervening "if this isn't a creature" is false (CR 603.4).

